+      "evidence": "\"We will know it is true when each of these checks holds:\" \"Out: running a review and deciding its findings (the review play, /check-change, owns it).\" \"When the memory tool cannot reach Phoenix memory, initialize stops and builds nothing, and says the Phoenix install must run on this machine.\" \"Choose the review rule groups (fn-review-rule-groups): records which rule groups of the review fit the project, so a review runs only those and names the groups it skipped.\"",
