+      "evidence": "\"A tracker is an outside system, and a write there is visible to the whole team.\" \"A second set of questions for the tracker or the review would ask the person the same things twice.\" \"An empty answer there would look like ... and leave the project with too little memory.\" \"These six jobs share one moment (the project is being set up) and one input (the product owner's answers), so they live in one capability.\"",
