+      "fix": ""
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "depth_gradient",
+      "verdict": "pass",
+      "evidence": "\"Initialize only records which rule groups fit; the review reads that record and names what it skipped.\" \"A memory block is the set of Phoenix memory files that one setup answer selects, for example the Java standards for a Java answer\"",
