++      "evidence": "\"A tracker cannot make a type when the adapter says the tracker has no way to add a type of its own, for example a tracker with a fixed list of types; that type gets a proposed stand-in.\" \"Out: a record of what was made and what was mapped, kept beside the mapping in the project's settings\" \"Given the account has no right to add a type to the organization, when initialize tries to make Epic, then it says in plain words that the make failed and why, proposes no stand-in, and Epic stays unmapped.\"",
