++      "fix": ""
++    },
++    {
++      "id": "stranger_test",
++      "verdict": "pass",
++      "evidence": "What: \"compares them with the types Garura's plays file ... After the product owner's typed yes, it makes each missing type and records what it made.\" Why: \"on 2026-10-25 Garura's own GitHub organization had no Epic type, so /shape-plan could not file an Epic as an Epic (#875). Every project meets the same gap the first time a play writes to its tracker.\" Edges: \"Filing epics, stories and other work items (/shape-plan and the other filing plays own them).\" A cold reader can explain the what, why and edges from the doc alone; the only soft spot is \"the same adapter\", which reads as the tracker's adapter from context.",
++      "fix": ""
